# Input

```vue
<template>
	<div :class="{ a: b } // note
"></div>
	<Comp #default="{ item } // note
"></Comp>
	<div v-if="a && b // note
"></div>
	<Comp #default="{ someVeryLongPropertyName, anotherVeryLongPropertyName, yetAnotherOne }"></Comp>
	<div v-for="item in someVeryLongListOfItemsName || anotherVeryLongListOfItemsName || []">{{ item }}</div>
	<div v-if="someVeryLongConditionName | anotherVeryLongConditionName | yetAnotherCondition"></div>
</template>

```


# Formatted

```vue
<template>
	<div
		:class="{
			a: b,
		} // note
		"
	></div>
	<Comp
		#default="{
			item,
		} // note
		"
	></Comp>
	<div
		v-if="
			a && b // note
		"
	></div>
	<Comp
		#default="{
			someVeryLongPropertyName,
			anotherVeryLongPropertyName,
			yetAnotherOne,
		}"
	></Comp>
	<div
		v-for="item in someVeryLongListOfItemsName ||
		anotherVeryLongListOfItemsName ||
		[]"
	>
		{{ item }}
	</div>
	<div
		v-if="
			someVeryLongConditionName |
			anotherVeryLongConditionName |
			yetAnotherCondition
		"
	></div>
</template>

```
